<title>SWEDEN: Stena Line 13 pct more passengers 1996.</title>
<headline>Stena Line 13 pct more passengers 1996.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish international ferry operator Stena Line AB said on Thursday passenger volumes rose 13 percent in 1996, mostly because of a sharp increase in passenger numbers on its key Dover-Calais route.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement it was still expecting a loss after financial items of 450 million crowns for the 1996 financial year.</p>
</text>
